# Root CA certificate pinned for the OpenWeatherMap HTTPS request
# (WeatherClass::request(), see Weather.cpp). Fetch and save the current
# one as data/owm-ca.pem (git-ignored):
#
#   echo | openssl s_client -connect api.openweathermap.org:443 -showcerts 2>/dev/null \
#     | awk '/BEGIN CERTIFICATE/{c++} c==3' > data/owm-ca.pem
#
# c==3 selects the top of the chain (the issuing root CA); adjust if
# OpenWeatherMap's certificate chain length changes.
